---
/**
 * Replaces plain Markdown tables. The wrapper is the scroll container, so a wide
 * table scrolls inside the measure instead of forcing the whole page sideways,
 * and `tabindex` makes that scroll reachable by keyboard.
 *
 * No `role="region"`: a Markdown table has no caption to name it, and an unnamed
 * region is worse than none. `ComparisonTable` has a caption and does use one.
 */
---

<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0">
  <table>
    <slot />
  </table>
</div>
